DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to celebrate the season with the Bloomington Symp
 hony Orchestra?\n\nPopcorn? Check.\nComfy chair? Check.\nLights turned down
  low? Check.\nThat special feeling of quiet anticipation you get when you h
 ear music from your favorite holiday films? Check! \nMusic from the Movies 
 is the theme of this year’s festive holiday celebration.\nChoose from the 5
 pm or 8pm show\, before or after enjoying Bloomington’s Canopy of Lights.\n
 \n\n5pm or 8pm Concert\nBuskirk-Chumley Theater\n\nIncluded as part of your
  Season Pass. Learn more here.\nIndividual tickets on sale in September at 
 the Buskirk-Chumley Box Office.
