DESCRIPTION:Or print and send in this order form. Orders are due: Thurs\, N
 ov 12\, 2026 Delivery and pick-up: Wed\, Dec 2\, 12-6 pm  First United Chur
 ch\, 2420 E 3rd Street   \n\nPoinsettias are the perfect way to add some fe
 stive sparkle at home or at work while supporting YOUR Bloomington Symphony
  Orchestra at the same time.  Our plants are healthy\, long-lasting\, and o
 verloaded with big\, beautiful blooms. They are grown locally by Galema’s G
 reenhouse in West Lafayette\, IN. \n\n\n\n$18: 6.5” pot has 1 plant\, 5+ bl
 ooms\, 14-18” high $30:  7.5” pot has 2 plants\, 10+ blooms\, 16-20″ high $
 60:  10” pot has 4 plants\, 20+ blooms\, 26-28” high \n\n\n\nContact us for
  discounts for nonprofits or orders over $200. \n\n\n\nGive the gift of poi
 nsettias! For only $5 we will deliver to any location in Bloomington. \n\n\
 n\nSpecial pricing available for nonprofits. Contact us for more informatio
 n: 812-369-4212\, poinsettias@bloomingtonsymphony.com \nShare this page wit
 h your friends! bloomingtonsymphony.com/poinsettia\, or share this flyer wi
 th your friends and family! \n\n\n\nThe BSO is a 501(c)3 nonprofit organiza
 tion – half of your total order is tax deductible. Thank you for supporting
  YOUR Bloomington Symphony Orchestra!
